(1, 'DC Circuits', 'easy', 'Three resistors of 6 Ω, 12 Ω and 4 Ω are connected in parallel. What is the equivalent resistance?', '["1 Ω","2 Ω","4 Ω","22 Ω"]'::jsonb, 1, '1/Req = 1/6 + 1/12 + 1/4
