(2, 'DC Circuits', 'easy', 'A 12 V source is connected to a 4 Ω and an 8 Ω resistor in series. What is the voltage across the 8 Ω resistor?', '["4 V","6 V","8 V","12 V"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Rt = 4 + 8 = 12 Ω
I = V/Rt = 12/12 = 1 A
