(3, 'DC Circuits', 'medium', 'A heater rated 1500 W at 120 V is operating at its rating. What is its resistance?', '["8.0 Ω","9.6 Ω","12.5 Ω","18.0 Ω"]'::jsonb, 1, 'P = V²/R
