(4, 'AC Circuits', 'medium', 'A series RL circuit has R = 30 Ω and XL = 40 Ω and is connected to a 120 V source. Find the current.', '["1.7 A","2.4 A","3.0 A","4.0 A"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Z = √(R² + XL²) = √(30² + 40²) = √2500 = 50 Ω
