(5, 'AC Circuits', 'medium', 'For the same series RL circuit (R = 30 Ω, XL = 40 Ω, 120 V), what is the real power consumed?', '["288 W","172.8 W","230.4 W","120 W"]'::jsonb, 1, 'I = 120/50 = 2.4 A
