(Check: S = VI = 288 VA, pf = R/Z = 0.6, P = 288 × 0.6 = 172.8 W)', 15),
(6, 'AC Circuits', 'hard', 'A series RLC circuit has L = 10 mH and C = 10 µF. What is its resonant frequency?', '["159 Hz","503 Hz","1007 Hz","3162 Hz"]'::jsonb, 1, 'fr = 1 / (2π√(LC))
LC = (10×10⁻³)(10×10⁻⁶) = 1×10⁻⁷
√(LC) = 3.162×10⁻⁴
fr = 1 / (2π × 3.162×10⁻⁴) = 1 / 1.987×10⁻³ ≈ 503 Hz', 20),
(7, 'Electrostatics', 'easy', 'Two point charges of 2 µC each are placed 0.3 m apart in air. What is the force between them? (k = 9×10⁹ N·m²/C²)', '["0.12 N","0.4 N","1.2 N","4.0 N"]'::jsonb, 1, 'F = k q1 q2 / r²
