e = 200 × (0.04 / 0.2) = 200 × 0.2 = 40 V', 15),
(11, 'Magnetic Circuits', 'easy', 'A coil of 500 turns carries 2 A around a magnetic path 0.4 m long. What is the magnetic field intensity H?', '["1000 AT/m","1250 AT/m","2500 AT/m","5000 AT/m"]'::jsonb, 2, 'mmf = NI = 500 × 2 = 1000 ampere-turns
