(12, 'Instrumentation', 'medium', 'A d''Arsonval movement has a full-scale current of 50 µA. If it is used as a 100 V voltmeter, what is the total resistance of the meter (movement + multiplier)?', '["20 kΩ","200 kΩ","2 MΩ","20 MΩ"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Total resistance = Vfs / Ifs
