(13, 'DC Generators', 'medium', 'A shunt generator delivers 100 A to the load at 230 V terminal voltage. The field current is 5 A and the armature resistance is 0.1 Ω. Find the generated emf (neglect brush drop).', '["230.0 V","240.0 V","240.5 V","241.0 V"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Ia = IL + If = 100 + 5 = 105 A
