(14, 'DC Motors', 'medium', 'A shunt motor is connected to a 230 V supply and draws an armature current of 40 A. If Ra = 0.5 Ω, what is the mechanical power developed by the armature?', '["8.4 kW","9.2 kW","8.0 kW","20 kW"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Back emf Eb = V − Ia·Ra = 230 − (40)(0.5) = 210 V
