(9.2 kW is the electrical input to the armature, V × Ia)', 15),
(15, 'Alternators', 'easy', 'An 8-pole alternator generates 60 Hz. What is its synchronous speed?', '["600 rpm","900 rpm","1200 rpm","1800 rpm"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Ns = 120 f / P
