(16, 'Transformers', 'medium', 'A 50 kVA, 2400/240 V single-phase transformer. What is the rated secondary current?', '["20.8 A","104.2 A","208.3 A","2083 A"]'::jsonb, 2, 'I2 = kVA × 1000 / V2 = 50,000 / 240 = 208.3 A
