(17, 'Transformers', 'hard', 'A 10 kVA transformer has a core loss of 100 W and a copper loss of 150 W at full load. What is the full-load efficiency at unity power factor?', '["95.0%","96.6%","97.6%","98.5%"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Output = 10 kVA × 1.0 = 10,000 W
