(Dividing by the no-load voltage would wrongly give 9.1%.)', 15),
(21, 'Faults', 'hard', 'A generator rated 10 MVA has a total fault impedance of 0.2 per unit on its own base. What is the three-phase short-circuit MVA?', '["2 MVA","10 MVA","50 MVA","200 MVA"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Fault current (pu) = 1 / Zpu = 1 / 0.2 = 5 pu
