(22, 'Illumination', 'easy', 'A point source of 1000 cd hangs 4 m directly above a table. What is the illuminance on the table directly below it?', '["62.5 lux","250 lux","1000 lux","15.6 lux"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Inverse-square law: E = I / d²
