(23, 'Rectifiers & Converters', 'medium', 'A single-phase full-wave rectifier has a peak output voltage Vm = 170 V. What is the average (dc) output voltage?', '["54.1 V","108.2 V","120.2 V","170 V"]'::jsonb, 1, 'For a full-wave rectifier: Vdc = 2 Vm / π
