(24, 'Power Plants', 'hard', 'A hydroelectric plant has a net head of 50 m and a flow of 10 m³/s. If the overall efficiency is 80%, what is the electrical output?', '["3.14 MW","3.92 MW","4.91 MW","39.2 MW"]'::jsonb, 1, 'P = ρ g Q H η
