(25, 'Power Plants', 'medium', 'A 100 MW plant generates 438,000 MWh in a year (8760 hours). What is its capacity factor?', '["25%","50%","75%","100%"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Maximum possible energy = 100 MW × 8760 h = 876,000 MWh
