(26, 'DC Circuits', 'easy', 'A 24 V source is connected across an 8 Ω resistor. What is the current?', '["0.33 A","3 A","8 A","192 A"]'::jsonb, 1, 'I = V/R = 24/8 = 3 A', 10),
