(28, 'DC Circuits', 'medium', 'A 100 V source is connected to 20 kΩ and 30 kΩ resistors in series. What is the voltage across the 30 kΩ resistor?', '["40 V","50 V","60 V","75 V"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Voltage divider:
