(55, 'Instrumentation', 'medium', 'A 1 mA, 50 Ω meter movement is to be a 10 V full-scale voltmeter. What series multiplier resistance is needed?', '["9.95 kΩ","10 kΩ","50 kΩ","100 Ω"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Rtotal = V/Im = 10/0.001 = 10,000 Ω
