(56, 'Instrumentation', 'hard', 'Two wattmeters measure a balanced three-phase load and read 4 kW and 2 kW (both positive). What is the power factor?', '["0.5","0.707","0.866","0.95"]'::jsonb, 2, 'tan φ = √3 (W1 − W2)/(W1 + W2) = √3 × 2/6 = 0.577
