(59, 'DC Generators', 'medium', 'The same machine (4 poles, Z = 400, Φ = 0.02 Wb, 1000 rpm) is rewound as wave-wound. What is the emf now?', '["133.3 V","200 V","266.7 V","533 V"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Wave winding: A = 2
